title Cassette REC from the blank cassette: the cassette is already there, REC only turns the hubs (no appearance animation); the label follows the existing behaviour for a recording take
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO deckempty
env CASSETTE_ANIM_TICKS 12
env CASSETTE_ANIM_FPS 60
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
shot blank-before-rec
key r
wait 600
expect text "PAUSE"
shot blank-rec
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
expect noquit
